            strokes: 'Filled outline of a reversed 3: a head at the upper left cut on a slant, the upper curve swelling right and down to the waist, the lower curve running down and round to the left to a heavy upright end; from the waist a long tapering beak rising to the upper right, and a forked tongue with a round upper head pointing left into the letter.',
